WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.379
Today your child reads a whole story. Tomorrow, the same story again.

2
00:00:04.829 --> 00:00:11.641
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:12.141 --> 00:00:13.757
These are today's two pages.

4
00:00:14.207 --> 00:00:17.873
First, your child reads the eight story words, each all at once.

5
00:00:18.323 --> 00:00:24.255
Then turn to the story. You read the first two lines smoothly. Your child says each line after you.

6
00:00:24.705 --> 00:00:27.975
Then step away. Your child reads the whole story alone.

7
00:00:28.425 --> 00:00:33.088
Every word in it is one your child can sound out, or one of the six little words.

8
00:00:33.538 --> 00:00:39.802
After the story, your child circles three pictures on the first page. That shows you the story made sense.

9
00:00:40.252 --> 00:00:44.352
Tomorrow, your child reads the story once more, before the final check.

10
00:00:44.802 --> 00:00:48.786
The second reading is easier. Ask your child: did you hear the difference?
